cks another bucket's behaviour. This serves [requirement:req-94eee275db]."}], "files": [{"path": "tb/tb_repro_data_byte.v", "kind": "testbench", "title": "Repro B1: data bits must be sent LSB first", "summary": "Self-checking repro for bucket B1 of [requirement:req-94eee275db]. It runs against [artifact:prj-c391b404ed.design-under-investigation.a1] and samples data bits 1..8 at mid-bit for four bytes, expecting LSB first. It does not depend on parity or stop length. It prints the NIRMAAN-SIM verdict once.", "entry": "tb_repro_data_byte"}, {"path": "tb/tb_repro_parity_bit.v", "kind": "testbench", "title": "Repro B2: parity bit must be even parity", "summary": "Self-checking repro for bucket B2 of [requirement:req-94eee275db]. It runs against [artifact:prj-c391b404ed.design-under-investigation.a1] and samples bit 9 at mid-bit, expecting ^data. Bit order and stop length do not affect this check. It prints the NIRMAAN-SIM verdict once.", "entry": "tb_repro_parity_bit"}, {"path": "tb/tb_repro_frame_period.v", "kind": "testbench", "title": "Repro B3: frame must last 11*CLKS_PER_BIT cycles", "summary": "Self-checking repro for bucket B3 of [requirement:req-94eee275db]. It runs against [artifact:prj-c391b404ed.design-under-investigation.a1] and counts busy-high cycles per frame, expecting 44 at CLKS_PER_BIT=4. It does not depend on data or parity values. It prints the NIRMAAN-SIM verdict once.", "entry": "tb_repro_frame_period"}], "tool_runs": ["run-0001"], "claims": ["Log-to-bucket mapping is inferred from the log file names: data_byte_fail.log to B1, parity_bit_fail.log to B2, frame_period_fail.log to B3. The log contents were not available to this seat.", "Expected busy-high count on a correct design is 44 cycles: 4 start + 32 data + 4 parity + 4 stop. On the buggy RTL it is 42 by hand analysis.", "Per-log VeriTriage runs and same-seed reruns to rule out flakiness have not been performed."], "escalation": null, "notes": "VeriTriage was called once on the combined log set